    "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "I didn't see an option in the config mappings and the usual `<C-d/u>` or `<C-f/b>` was not working. How do we scroll the docs popup? Thanks!",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I didn't see an option in the config mappings and the usual <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;C-d/u&gt;</code> or <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;C-f/b&gt;</code> was not working. How do we scroll the docs popup? Thanks!</p>",
    "bodyText": "I didn't see an option in the config mappings and the usual <C-d/u> or <C-f/b> was not working. How do we scroll the docs popup? Thanks!",
